**Package:** `exllamav3` v0.0.30+cu128.torch2.10.0

**Dependencies:**
- torch >= 2.6.0
- flash-attn >= 2.7.4.post1
- tokenizers >= 0.21.1
- numpy >= 2.1.0
- rich
- typing-extensions
- ninja
- safetensors >= 0.3.2
- pyyaml
- marisa-trie
- kbnf >= 0.4.2
- formatron >= 0.5.0
- pydantic == 2.11.0
- xformers

**Key modules:**
- `exllamav3_ext.cpython-313-x86_64-linux-gnu.so` (551 MB compiled CUDA extension)
- `exllamav3/` — main Python package
  - `architecture/` — model support (qwen3, qwen3_5, qwen3_moe, qwen3_vl, gemma4, step3_5, minimax_m2, olmo3, etc.)
  - `cache/` — KV cache management (fp16, quant, recurrent)
  - `conversion/` — model conversion, quantization, calibration
  - `exllamav3_ext/` — CUDA kernels (attention, GEMM, norm, graph, etc.)
